  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The arrow fractures the fibula, one of the long bones in the lower leg, as it slams through, tearing a gaping wound through the calf. Shards of the fibula can momentarily be seen before the flow of blood obscures them.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (1) and @Condition[Bleeding] (2). Also, your M is reduced to 1 and you’ll suffer a -30 penalty to all Tests involving the leg until the bone has set in 30 minus your Toughness Bonus days.</p><p>Extraction will be <strong>Challenging (+0)</strong>.</p>"
